<title>USA: UtiliCorp unit gets Beloit, Kan.contract.</title>
<headline>UtiliCorp unit gets Beloit, Kan.contract.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UtiliCorp United Inc said Tuesday its EnTrust Energy Solutions unit has received a $1.1 million contract to expand the supply of electricity in Beloit, Kan.</p>
<p>The contract calls for EnTrust to install a new substation outside Beloit designed to access excess power from an area transmission line when electric power demands increase beyond normal levels, UtiliCorp said.</p>
<p>UtiliCorp shares closed up 1/4 at 30-1/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
